Introduction 

Suppose array [1,2,3,4]
prefix sum of 1 = 0
prefix sum of 2 = arr[0] 
prefix sum of 3 = arr[0] + arr[1]
prefix sum of 4 = arr[0] +arr[1] +arr[2]

*** prefix[i] = prefix[i-1] + arr[i-1]

such that lets take suffix sum 
suffix sum of 4 = 0
suffix sum of 3 = arr[4]
suffix sum of 2 = arr[4] + arr[3]
suffix sum of 1 = arr[4] + arr[3] + arr[2]

*** suffix[i] = suffix[i+1] + arr[i+1]

